      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "宿主与入口",
      "items": [
        "index.html → main.js → dist-ts 模块（顺序加载，critical 优先）",
        "功能区经 window._bgmRibbonReady + Invalidate 接管按钮",
        "主/设置面板由 CreateTaskPane 创建"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "分层运行时",
